      "constraints": [
        "Time limit: 4 sec; Memory limit: 1024 MiB; Constraints: 2 \\leq N \\leq 3000; N-1 \\leq M \\leq \\min\\lbrace N(N-1)/2, 3000\\rbrace; 1 \\leq K \\leq 3000; 1 \\leq u_i, v_i \\leq N; u_i \\neq v_i; i \\neq j \\implies \\lbrace u_i, v_i\\rbrace \\neq \\lbrace u_j, v_j \\rbrace; The given graph is connected.; C_i \\in \\lbrace 0, 1\\rbrace; All values in the input are integers."
